### attach lima:user-v2 to dbcm-lab-m1

```
$ limactl edit --tty=false --network=lima:user-v2 dbcm-lab-m1
time="2026-10-19T16:29:59+02:00" level=info msg="Instance `dbcm-lab-m1` configuration edited"
(exit 0)
```

